- Principles: keep "Baton must not require a UI"; allow an optional UI
  client over the CLI and MCP (suggested text for §0 rule 3, §1.1 #3,
  §1.3 and a new §1.4 key decision).
- The UI's technology is open (full web app allowed), installed as an
  optional extra; criterion: the suite passes without it.
- Key replacement (checked before overwrite) and disconnect added.
- Starting CLI logins from the page: out of scope (owner, 2026-11-10).

